{"vid":"ygLbldJF_dc","source":"ygLbldJF_dc.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":14.8,"txt":"I'm so excited about this this is a"},{"t":16.7,"txt":"video unlike any I have made before"},{"t":19.2,"txt":"where we get to see the way that a wel"},{"t":21.3,"txt":"pool moves in a totally new way super"},{"t":25.2,"txt":"slow motion and clear shots of the whole"},{"t":29,"txt":"surface of the weld pool I'm able to do"},{"t":31.4,"txt":"this with a new weld visualization"},{"t":33.6,"txt":"system for scientific evaluation of"},{"t":35.6,"txt":"welds from Crone technology consisting"},{"t":37.7,"txt":"of one of their high-speed cameras as"},{"t":39.4,"txt":"well as some special LED lights that"},{"t":41.7,"txt":"have a really high brightness this is"},{"t":43.8,"txt":"just a prototype of the system and I'll"},{"t":45.5,"txt":"show you a little bit more about how it"},{"t":46.9,"txt":"works at the end of the video the first"},{"t":49.4,"txt":"welding process we'll look at is TIG"},{"t":51.3,"txt":"welding TIG welding uses a torch that"},{"t":54.2,"txt":"looks like this and has a pointed"},{"t":57.4,"txt":"electrode electricity flows from that to"},{"t":60.3,"txt":"the workpiece to form an arc and you add"},{"t":63.6,"txt":"a filler metal into a molten weld pool"},{"t":67.5,"txt":"when you're actually welding with TIG"},{"t":69.5,"txt":"this is pretty close to what you're able"},{"t":71.3,"txt":"to"},{"t":72.4,"txt":"see if we take a closer look you can see"},{"t":75.6,"txt":"why cleaning your material is really"},{"t":77.6,"txt":"important even the little bit of"},{"t":79.9,"txt":"contamination from this clean material"},{"t":82.4,"txt":"gets drawn right into that weld pool and"},{"t":85.1,"txt":"floats there on the"},{"t":86.6,"txt":"surface once a pool is formed you can"},{"t":89.2,"txt":"add filler metal to it the point at"},{"t":92,"txt":"which you add the filler metal is really"},{"t":93.7,"txt":"important because you want that weld"},{"t":95.8,"txt":"pool to melt it you can see that filler"},{"t":98.4,"txt":"being pressed in there this whole dab of"},{"t":101,"txt":"filler took just a fraction of a second"},{"t":103.4,"txt":"in"},{"t":104.2,"txt":"reality as it solidifies notice how"},{"t":107.4,"txt":"everything will shrink down and it will"},{"t":110.4,"txt":"sink down into a crater left at the"},{"t":115.8,"txt":"end now hear that clicking that is a"},{"t":119.4,"txt":"pulse TIG weld it looks like a regular"},{"t":122.4,"txt":"TIG weld but it's actually alternating"},{"t":124.5,"txt":"between a higher and lower power level"},{"t":127.1,"txt":"as you run the weld this is pretty"},{"t":129.5,"txt":"common to do to avoid Distortion but if"},{"t":133.2,"txt":"we take a closer look notice how even"},{"t":135.8,"txt":"though this pulsing happens 30 times"},{"t":139.3,"txt":"every single second with each pulse you"},{"t":142.6,"txt":"can actually see the weld puddle grow"},{"t":144.9,"txt":"and oscillate it's amazing to see it"},{"t":147.4,"txt":"drive that let's turn it up to1 20 times"},{"t":150.7,"txt":"per second and you can see how much more"},{"t":153.4,"txt":"weld pool motion there is when you do"},{"t":156,"txt":"that all of this welding has been done"},{"t":158.4,"txt":"on steel let's move to aluminum and look"},{"t":160.9,"txt":"at some of the interesting things that"},{"t":162.4,"txt":"happen there when you TIG weld aluminum"},{"t":165.6,"txt":"we actually use an alternating current"},{"t":169.4,"txt":"and this etches the surface off of the"},{"t":172.8,"txt":"aluminum so notice there's a frosty"},{"t":175.3,"txt":"layer right around the outside of the"},{"t":178.5,"txt":"weld that's where where the alternating"},{"t":180.8,"txt":"current is actually etching and cleaning"},{"t":183.7,"txt":"the surface of the aluminum to give"},{"t":186,"txt":"clean metal for a sound weld let's watch"},{"t":189.1,"txt":"what happens here when we move in"},{"t":191.4,"txt":"closer when the ark starts most machines"},{"t":194.4,"txt":"will give a huge rush of current to give"},{"t":196.9,"txt":"a nice crisp start notice those flickers"},{"t":200.7,"txt":"that happen on the surface of the"},{"t":202.9,"txt":"material each time that flicker happens"},{"t":206.6,"txt":"it's when the torch is changing to"},{"t":209.2,"txt":"Electric"},{"t":210.2,"txt":"positive and it's just breaking up some"},{"t":212.8,"txt":"of that surface layer to clean it and"},{"t":215.9,"txt":"expose nice fresh bare metal that can"},{"t":220,"txt":"have an acceptable weld notice how it's"},{"t":222.9,"txt":"breaking it up each time it switches to"},{"t":226,"txt":"that positive side so the tungsten"},{"t":229.3,"txt":"electrode is positive it breaks off a"},{"t":231.8,"txt":"little bit more and now you can see a"},{"t":234.4,"txt":"puddle start to form in the center that"},{"t":237.3,"txt":"puddle will grow and even as it grows"},{"t":241.5,"txt":"the etching continues out around the"},{"t":244,"txt":"Weld and this is what makes welding on"},{"t":246.5,"txt":"aluminum work so well with TIG it"},{"t":249.5,"txt":"continues to cause that pulsation every"},{"t":253.5,"txt":"time it switches between positive and"},{"t":255.8,"txt":"negative and that's just a lot of"},{"t":257.9,"txt":"movement in the puddle that you really"},{"t":259.5,"txt":"can't see when you're running a"},{"t":261.6,"txt":"weld now this continues even during the"},{"t":265.2,"txt":"welding process when you're adding"},{"t":266.9,"txt":"filler metal notice once again it's"},{"t":269.4,"txt":"really important where the filler metal"},{"t":271.2,"txt":"is added to the weld pool so that the"},{"t":274,"txt":"puddle itself will melt it and not the"},{"t":276.7,"txt":"heat from the"},{"t":278.1,"txt":"ark as the weld filler comes off it's a"},{"t":281.5,"txt":"nice chiseled Edge that's a good sign"},{"t":285.2,"txt":"that etching effect continues to lead"},{"t":288.2,"txt":"the Weld and give nice clean aluminum"},{"t":291.7,"txt":"watch what happens if you accidentally"},{"t":293.8,"txt":"dip your tungsten electrode down into"},{"t":295.7,"txt":"the filler metal it only touched here"},{"t":298.7,"txt":"for a fraction of a second but in that"},{"t":301.9,"txt":"time it created a lot of contamination"},{"t":305.8,"txt":"right here that's why it's really"},{"t":307.8,"txt":"important when this happens if you're"},{"t":309.6,"txt":"welding on something critical to take"},{"t":311.6,"txt":"the time to clean everything"},{"t":323.1,"txt":"off now let's look at some MIG welding"},{"t":326,"txt":"which uses a gun like this and feeds"},{"t":328.6,"txt":"wire out the gun and the electric C goes"},{"t":332.2,"txt":"between the wire and the workpiece so"},{"t":334.1,"txt":"it's melting all the time as it feeds in"},{"t":336.4,"txt":"there it works really well and when"},{"t":338.8,"txt":"you're running a mig weld through the"},{"t":340.8,"txt":"welding helmet you see something that"},{"t":342.5,"txt":"looks like this as your weld pool fills"},{"t":345.2,"txt":"in there's actually a lot going on here"},{"t":348.5,"txt":"and we can see a lot of that as we slow"},{"t":350.3,"txt":"it down now this particular type of gas"},{"t":353.7,"txt":"metal AR welding is called short circuit"},{"t":356.8,"txt":"transfer and that's because the wire"},{"t":359.2,"txt":"goes goes down and it will actually"},{"t":360.8,"txt":"short out and create a short circuit"},{"t":363.4,"txt":"between the welding wire and the"},{"t":365.4,"txt":"workpiece that's why the ark goes out"},{"t":367.5,"txt":"over and over again and each time that"},{"t":369.6,"txt":"it does one of those droplets transfers"},{"t":372.1,"txt":"on shortcircuit Mig is the most common"},{"t":375.2,"txt":"process and it just runs a bit colder"},{"t":377.8,"txt":"because that Arc isn't lit all the time"},{"t":380.1,"txt":"you can see why there's so much spatter"},{"t":382.6,"txt":"and the sparks fly off of there because"},{"t":384.7,"txt":"of how much is going on here with the"},{"t":386.7,"txt":"process and that Arc going on and off"},{"t":388.8,"txt":"all the time and running into the molten"},{"t":390.8,"txt":"weld pool that's also what gives it the"},{"t":393.4,"txt":"signature sound that you get when you're"},{"t":395,"txt":"MIG welding where it's not just a hum or"},{"t":397.2,"txt":"a buzz with short circuit Mig you get"},{"t":400,"txt":"that kind of rattly buzzing sound that"},{"t":403.6,"txt":"uh is is so indicative of an arc that's"},{"t":406.1,"txt":"running right which is like this let's"},{"t":408.8,"txt":"look at one last process that's shielded"},{"t":410.8,"txt":"metal arc welding or stick welding now"},{"t":413.2,"txt":"when you're stick welding you just"},{"t":414.7,"txt":"manually feed in a rod that's covered"},{"t":416.8,"txt":"with flux and you have an electric AR"},{"t":419.7,"txt":"between the end of that rod and your"},{"t":421.1,"txt":"workpiece to provide the Heat this is"},{"t":423.6,"txt":"what you can see when you're running a"},{"t":424.9,"txt":"stick weld if we look up closer however"},{"t":427.9,"txt":"you can see that electrode on the left"},{"t":430.3,"txt":"side and the weld pool there's a lot of"},{"t":433.3,"txt":"motion in the weld pool but the part"},{"t":435.6,"txt":"that's really interesting is over"},{"t":437.2,"txt":"towards the right side of the screen you"},{"t":439.5,"txt":"can see where the flux off the outside"},{"t":442.1,"txt":"of the electrode actually floats up on"},{"t":445,"txt":"top of that weld pool as it solidifies"},{"t":448.4,"txt":"creating a slap coating that you usually"},{"t":451,"txt":"have to chip off I think it's"},{"t":453.3,"txt":"fascinating to actually see that slag"},{"t":456.6,"txt":"rising up out of the molten weld pool"},{"t":459.7,"txt":"and coating over the solidified part of"},{"t":463,"txt":"the weld there's some really smart"},{"t":465.2,"txt":"Engineering in that chemistry can you"},{"t":467.9,"txt":"weld there are so many interesting"},{"t":470.1,"txt":"things going on and you can only see a"},{"t":472.1,"txt":"fraction of it when you're looking"},{"t":473.6,"txt":"through a welding hood or with clips"},{"t":476.2,"txt":"from a traditional camera well this this"},{"t":480,"txt":"is a setup that was specifically"},{"t":482.2,"txt":"designed to be able to see that"},{"t":484.3,"txt":"underlying physics and the things you"},{"t":486.2,"txt":"don't normally see with a weld pool so"},{"t":489.3,"txt":"what this is is a high-speed camera I"},{"t":491.8,"txt":"was able to borrow to take a few clips"},{"t":494.9,"txt":"and give some feedback on a new system"},{"t":496.9,"txt":"that was developed and it filters out"},{"t":501,"txt":"all the light from the welding Arc and"},{"t":503.3,"txt":"only accepts the wavelength of light"},{"t":505.6,"txt":"that comes out of these lights right"},{"t":508.1,"txt":"here so that you you can get a clear"},{"t":510,"txt":"view of the whole weld pool and see"},{"t":512.3,"txt":"exactly what's going on on top of that"},{"t":515.1,"txt":"it can film at 1,000 frames per second"},{"t":517.7,"txt":"or even higher if you reduce the"},{"t":519.4,"txt":"resolution so you can see the fluid"},{"t":522.2,"txt":"motion and some really cool stuff thank"},{"t":526,"txt":"you all for tuning in and sticking with"},{"t":527.7,"txt":"me throughout this video and a huge"},{"t":529.3,"txt":"thanks to Crone technology for letting"},{"t":531,"txt":"me borrow this camera to be able to"},{"t":533,"txt":"produce this footage and share it out"},{"t":534.8,"txt":"there with the world if you enjoyed this"},{"t":536.9,"txt":"video or learned something let me know"},{"t":538.3,"txt":"by hitting that thumbs up below or"},{"t":539.8,"txt":"leaving me a comment and we'll see you"},{"t":541.5,"txt":"next time"}],"words":[{"t":14.839,"w":"I'm"},{"t":15.12,"w":"so"},{"t":15.44,"w":"excited"},{"t":15.839,"w":"about"},{"t":16.16,"w":"this"},{"t":16.32,"w":"this"},{"t":16.44,"w":"is"},{"t":16.52,"w":"a"},{"t":16.68,"w":"video"},{"t":17,"w":"unlike"},{"t":1